    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d216">

                <pb facs="0300" n="224" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg224"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 839.00/1814</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-05-05T19:00:00-04:40">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 5, 1916, 7 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Forces of the President advanced to city to-day. Legation in line of fire from
                    Arias for several hours. Landing force from <hi rendition="#italic">Prairie</hi>
                    arrived at Legation four o’clock, coming in rear of Jiménez troops. Sharp firing
                    in the city still. Result not known. Disturbed conditions other parts Republic
                    demand presence more ships.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Russell</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
